From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 03:30:05 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 53/61] Meridian: a click on the page closes the Site Control
 Center; hand cursor on buttons; no Sound row

The page's own process got the click, so the controls stayed open; a layer
of the controls over the page catches it now. Buttons in the panels, the home
page, the welcome tour and Settings show the hand cursor. The Site Control
Center no longer lists Sound.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
